    <sys:String x:Key="About_Title">About BeatzOnKeys</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="About_Version">Version {0}</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="About_Developer">BeatzOnKeys by MusicCat-61</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="About_Description">A keyboard player: music from local files and from YouTube plays continuously while typing controls the volume. Each key press lifts the volume to the maximum in 50 ms, and without input it eases back to the minimum. The maximum and minimum levels, the idle timeout, the music reaction and the list behaviour are configured in the panel on the right. Start plays the active tab from the beginning. The YouTube section searches, previews and caches tracks through yt-dlp.</sys:String>
